'''Dana Clemmer Wells Jr.''' (born August 5, 1966) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[nose tackle]] in the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[Arizona Wildcats football|Arizona Wildcats]].
